b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"b9f8f7c9bcb83cea","term":"닫다","zh":"关门，结束，打烊","audio":"/audio/b9f8f7c9bcb83cea095f.mp3","entryId":"57289","definition":"结束一天的营业。","pronunciation":["닫따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5e8cc2fcec94ff606dd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57289-2-8-2","ko":"요즘은 네 시 반이면 닫죠.","zh":"最近是四点半就关门了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}},{"text":"반이면","meaning":"一半，半","explanation":"반：一半，半；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57623","senseId":"1","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반이면","audio":"/audio/c7f5600353fa9873ff96.mp3"}},{"t